The numbers is a list of 5, 4, 3, 2, and 1.
Sort numbers.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The powers is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into powers.
For every step from 0 to last minus 1.
The tail is item step of powers.
The next is (tail times 2) modulo 1000000007.
Place next into powers.

The total is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The leftpower is item spot of powers.
The mirror is last minus spot.
The rightpower is item mirror of powers.
The gap is leftpower minus rightpower.
If gap is less than 0, add 1000000007 to gap.
The value is item spot of numbers.
The term is (value times gap) modulo 1000000007.
Add term to total.
Set total to total modulo 1000000007.

Show total.
